VERSION 2
RULE ios.webview-file-access VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\bsetValue\\s*\\(\\s*true\\s*,\\s*forKey\\s*:\\s*\"(?:allowFileAccessFromFileURLs|allowUniversalAccessFromFileURLs)\"" ""
REPORT "WKWebView File Access Enabled Through Preferences"
SEVERITY MEDIUM
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
